you can only charge a wand of wishing once. The second time you charge
it, it explodes. To get the maximum number of wishes out of it, you
must use all the charges (up to 3 charges) before charging it. Then you
get another 3 charges. Then, you can wrest one last charge out of it by
repeat-zapping it (requires about a hundred zaps on average, if memory
serves correct.) This gives you a maximum of 7 wishes from a 0:3 wand
of wishing. It is a big help if you can identify the wand as soon as
you find it.

For example, you find the wand at 0:3. You zap it for 3 wishes and it
goes to 0:0. Now, if you zapped it again, you'd probably get "nothing
happens", but there's a small cahnce you "wrest one last charge" from
it, and have it turn to dust. This is why you should try to ID the
wand- so you can see if it's got another recharge in it. Anyway, the
best thing to do with a 0:0 wand is to recharge it. This brings it up
to 1:3, and you can get 3 more immediate wishes. Now it is at 1:0, and
further attempts to charge it will result in explosion, so the best you
can do now is to wrest that last wish out.


